        "department": null,
        "description": "The development of AI systems is becoming increasingly important in Computer Science. The goals of this course are to enable students to: (a) understand the basic concepts of AI / Intelligent Systems, (b) introduce to the students the techniques used to build intelligent systems and the associated processing techniques, and (c) give an overview of various sub-fields of AI such as Natural Language Processing, Robotics etc.",
        "prerequisites_mandatory": [
