            "raw_text": "Ability to Describe 'What is Intelligence', 'What are Intelligent Systems', 'How basic Intelligent Systems work', and 'Different kinds of Intelligent Systems'"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO2",
            "raw_text": "Ability to Explain basic Intelligent Systems Representation, Reasoning and Processing techniques"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO3",
